# epito: the agent's credentials and run state, never committed — the same line
# `epito init` writes into every roster it touches (cli/src/lib/gitignore.js).
# This repo is also a roster, and a run that smoke-tests `epito worker` here
# writes .epito/audit.jsonl in the working tree; without this line one did, and
# committed it, and smoke-roster's "no .epito/ in the repository" checks failed.
.epito/
